# The board is GENERATED from .claude/scorecard.jsonl on every run, and published as an Artifact.
# Committing it would put a second copy of the same numbers under version control, guaranteed to
# disagree with the ledger the moment anyone grades without regenerating.
.claude/scorecard.html

# Per-machine hook state: when the last prompt arrived and how many turns went ungraded. It is the
# skipped-grade check's memory, it differs on every machine, and committing it would make one
# machine's count everyone's.
.claude/.mentor-turn
